22 33 43s 44 53s 54s 55 64s 65o 65s 66 74s 75s 76o 76s 77 85s 86s 87o 87s 88 96s 97o 97s 98o 98s 99 A2o A2s A3o A3s A4o A4s A5o A5s A6o A6s A7o A7s A8o A8s A9o A9s AA AJo AJs AKo AKs AQo AQs ATo ATs J4s J5s J6s J7o J7s J8o J8s J9o J9s JJ JTo JTs K2s K3s K4s K5o K5s K6o K6s K7o K7s K8o K8s K9o K9s KJo KJs KK KQo KQs KTo KTs Q2s Q3s Q4s Q5s Q6s Q7o Q7s Q8o Q8s Q9o Q9s QJo QJs QQ QTo QTs T6s T7o T7s T8o T8s T9o T9s TT

